    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>u</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mi>v</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math>,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>v</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mover><mi>w</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>v</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>w</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>u</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mover><mi>v</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math>, then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>u</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mover><mi>w</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math>&nbsp;is equal to",
