  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>v</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>w</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>u</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mover><mi>v</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Taking dot product with&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>w</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math>, we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>w</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>v</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>w</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>w</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mover><mi>u</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>w</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mover><mi>v</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mover><mi>u</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mover><mi>w</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>w</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mover><mi>v</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mover><mi>u</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mover><mi>w</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Taking dot product with&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>v</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math>&nbsp;in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math>, we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>v</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>v</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>w</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>v</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mover><mi>u</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>v</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mover><mi>v</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>So, by&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math>, we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>u</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mover><mi>w</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p>",
